 we will primarily self-fund this effort from additional cost savings from other changes she is making as well as perhaps some other pockets we're continuing to trim.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/07/tenet-healthcare-corporation-thc-q2-2018-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"THC 2018 Q2","e":"thc","d":"2018-08-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel Cancelmi","x":"In regards to our $250 million of cost reduction initiatives, we are achieving these savings faster than we had expected, particularly at Conifer and now anticipate realizing about $195 million of the savings this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/07/tenet-healthcare-corporation-thc-q2-2018-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"THC 2018 Q2","e":"thc","d":"2018-08-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Daniel Cancelmi","x":"So the outlook that we have out there assumes that we continue to own and operate Conifer and obviously, we've raised the guidance several times recently based on the very strong performance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/07/tenet-healthcare-corporation-thc-q2-2018-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"THC 2018 Q3","e":"thc","d":"2018-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel Cancelmi","x":"And you're right about the cost reduction initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/06/tenet-healthcare-corp-thc-q3-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"THC 2018 Q3","e":"thc","d":"2018-11-06","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Ralph Giacobbe","x":"And then you attributed some of the lower outlook to I guess your payer mix expectations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/06/tenet-healthcare-corp-thc-q3-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"THC 2018 Q4","e":"thc","d":"2019-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ronald A. Rittenmeyer","x":"One of Saum's highest areas of focus in 2019 will be to lead the continued restructuring of our platform for organic growth in our hospitals.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/26/tenet-healthcare-corp-thc-q4-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"THC 2018 Q4","e":"thc","d":"2019-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ronald A. Rittenmeyer","x":"This is something I and the teams have been working on since, I arrived; revisiting and restructuring core strategies, aligning operations around the problem not the person, hiring the best talent possible, integrating functions, removing unnecessary processes and as a team focusing on the core…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/26/tenet-healthcare-corp-thc-q4-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"THC 2019 Q1","e":"thc","d":"2019-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"A.J. Rice","x":"And then the other aspect of it is, I know most of the margin improvement sounds like you're attributing that to management cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/30/tenet-healthcare-corp-thc-q1-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"THC 2019 Q1","e":"thc","d":"2019-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Patrick Feeney","x":"Just wondering if you can provide any update on the cost saving initiative, any color today on how that savings going to breakdown by segment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/30/tenet-healthcare-corp-thc-q1-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"THC 2019 Q1","e":"thc","d":"2019-04-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Daniel J. Cancelmi","x":"Volume growth strengthened in our hospital business, USPI continues to deliver strong and consistent operating results, Conifer is driving meaningful margin improvement and we have reiterated our outlook for 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/30/tenet-healthcare-corp-thc-q1-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"THC 2019 Q2","e":"thc","d":"2019-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel Cancelmi","x":"We also are very confident in terms of our ability to execute on our cost reduction initiatives, which right now are $450 million in aggregate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/tenet-healthcare-corp-thc-q2-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"THC 2019 Q2","e":"thc","d":"2019-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel Cancelmi","x":"As I mentioned in my prepared remarks, costs were up about 2.9% exclude the discount rate and we continue to execute on our cost reduction initiatives that we've talked about.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/tenet-healthcare-corp-thc-q2-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"THC 2019 Q2","e":"thc","d":"2019-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Daniel Cancelmi","x":"Conifer achieved the strongest financial quarter in its history, and we have reiterated our outlook for 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/tenet-healthcare-corp-thc-q2-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"THC 2019 Q2","e":"thc","d":"2019-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Pito Chickering","x":"Are there new headwinds on hospital EBITDA that prevented you from raising guidance?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/tenet-healthcare-corp-thc-q2-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"THC 2019 Q3","e":"thc","d":"2019-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ronald A. Rittenmeyer","x":"Jeff will be restructuring the commercial part of the business and developing a new stronger sales team.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/05/tenet-healthcare-corp-thc-q3-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"THC 2019 Q3","e":"thc","d":"2019-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ronald A. Rittenmeyer","x":"Dan will discuss the continued cost savings process.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/05/tenet-healthcare-corp-thc-q3-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"THC 2019 Q3","e":"thc","d":"2019-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Daniel Cancelmi","x":"We are reiterating our outlook for adjusted EBITDA notwithstanding more than $50 million of unanticipated headwinds so far this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/05/tenet-healthcare-corp-thc-q3-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"THC 2019 Q3","e":"thc","d":"2019-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Daniel Cancelmi","x":"And, we are reiterating our outlook for adjusted free cash flow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/05/tenet-healthcare-corp-thc-q3-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"THC 2019 Q4","e":"thc","d":"2020-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ronald A. Rittenmeyer","x":"We achieved $300 million in savings by the end of 2019, delivering on our cost savings initiatives and staying true to our commitment to ramp up efficiency efforts as part of Tenant's ongoing transformation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/25/tenet-healthcare-corp-thc-q4-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"THC 2019 Q4","e":"thc","d":"2020-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel Cancelmi","x":"The GAAP loss was primarily due to charges for our restructuring initiatives and early debt retirement costs related to our refinancings that locked in attractive interest rates, which reduced interest payments and cleared out any significant debt maturities until April 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/25/tenet-healthcare-corp-thc-q4-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"THC 2020 Q3","e":"thc","d":"2020-10-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Saum Sutaria","x":"…either partnered with outsourcers or others, where we're really working on managing the productivity of that staff at the same time and that will result in incremental opportunities for savings as we right-size effectively to the portfolio of cases that we're seeing in the hospitals these days.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/21/tenet-healthcare-corp-thc-q3-2020-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"THC 2020 Q4","e":"thc","d":"2021-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"A.J. Rice","x":"Going back to Ron's prepared comments, you said that when you embarked on the spin-off, you guys went out and tested the waters from an acquisition, or a divestiture standpoint and people weren't willing to pay you for what you saw as the potential for margin improvement and cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/tenet-healthcare-corp-thc-q4-2020-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"THC 2021 Q1","e":"thc","d":"2021-04-21","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ronald A. Rittenmeyer","x":"And although based on our expectations for the balance of the year we're raising our outlook, all together I should say, based on our expectations, we're raising our outlook for 2021 and Dan is going to get into those details.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/21/tenet-healthcare-corp-thc-q1-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"THC 2021 Q1","e":"thc","d":"2021-04-21","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Daniel Cancelmi","x":"In terms of our guidance, we increased our guidance $100 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/21/tenet-healthcare-corp-thc-q1-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"THC 2021 Q2","e":"thc","d":"2021-07-22","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Daniel Cancelmi","x":"As a result of another strong performance in the quarter and some additional grant income which was not forecasted, we increased our 2021 outlook for the second time this year, which I'll discuss further in a few minutes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/22/tenet-healthcare-corp-thc-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"THC 2021 Q2","e":"thc","d":"2021-07-22","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Daniel Cancelmi","x":"As you can see on the slide, we raised our guidance, $100 million after the first quarter due to our strong performance and grain income that we were able to recognize, which was not assumed in our original guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/22/tenet-healthcare-corp-thc-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"THC 2021 Q3","e":"thc","d":"2021-10-21","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Daniel Cancelmi","x":"And when we looked at it, we came in by $125 million ahead of our midpoint of our guidance about $100 million above the high-end of our range and we thought it was appropriate to increase our guidance about $100 million for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/21/tenet-healthcare-corp-thc-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"THC 2021 Q3","e":"thc","d":"2021-10-21","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Daniel Cancelmi","x":"So, we increased our guidance $100 million, we feel that's appropriate at this point in time, but we feel really good about how our hospitals are performing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/21/tenet-healthcare-corp-thc-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"THC 2025 Q2","e":"thc","d":"2025-07-22","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Sun Park","x":"We are confident in our ability to deliver on our increased outlook for 2025 as we continue to provide high-quality care for those in the communities we serve.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/22/tenet-thc-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"THC 2025 Q2","e":"thc","d":"2025-07-22","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Sun Park","x":"So, Pito Chickering, yeah, we obviously have very strong free cash flow performance, have increased our guidance for free cash flow after NCI, you know, up $195 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/22/tenet-thc-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"THC 2025 Q4","e":"thc","d":"2026-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sun Park","x":"Additionally, we are implementing cost savings plans to help mitigate this pressure and will continue to engage with our patients to ensure that they have good access to care.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/11/tenet-thc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"THC 2025 Q4","e":"thc","d":"2026-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Saumya Sutaria","x":"So, you know, we have a big cohort this year that usually takes about a year to start to work on new physician entry and restructuring of the operating schedules, you know, where possible, to bring some of that higher acuity in.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/11/tenet-thc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"THC 2026 Q1","e":"thc","d":"2026-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Saumya Sutaria","x":"We continue to make investments in technology to enable growth and streamline operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/tenet-thc-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"THC 2026 Q1","e":"thc","d":"2026-04-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Saumya Sutaria","x":"We are reaffirming our full-year guidance and will address our expectations for the full year in the future.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/tenet-thc-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"THC 2026 Q2","e":"thc","d":"2026-07-24","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Saumya Sutaria","x":"The guidance that we established at the beginning of the year was robust, given the dynamics the industry was facing, but so were our plans for realizing results from our recent growth investments and our expense and AI initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/24/tenet-thc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"THC 2026 Q2","e":"thc","d":"2026-07-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Saumya Sutaria","x":"And our job was to test that post all the divestitures and demonstrate that what we did with the portfolio restructuring would, in fact, add value for our shareholders over time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/24/tenet-thc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"THC 2026 Q2","e":"thc","d":"2026-07-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Saumya Sutaria","x":"We are confident in our ability to achieve our increased guidance as it is powered by continued strength in our core business drivers, same-store revenue growth, effective expense management and strong free cash flow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/24/tenet-thc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"THC 2026 Q2","e":"thc","d":"2026-07-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Sun Park","x":"We are pleased with our continued effective execution and remain confident in our ability to deliver on our increased outlook for '26.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/24/tenet-thc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"THC 2026 Q3","e":"thc","d":"2026-10-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Saumya Sutaria","x":"At this point in the year, we are raising our full year 2026 adjusted EBITDA guidance to a range of $5.05 to $5.2 billion which represents an increase of $195 million or 4% the midpoint of the range over our increased guidance after the second quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/tenet-thc-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"THC 2026 Q3","e":"thc","d":"2026-10-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Saumya Sutaria","x":"We are pleased with our continued effective execution and remain confident in our ability to deliver on our increased outlook for 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/tenet-thc-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[34,1,9327,0,0,0,7841,1122],[35,1,9649,0,0,0,7990,1259],[36,1,9311,0,0,0,6957,1845],[37,1,8230,0,0,0,6074,1621],[38,1,8393,0,0,0,6186,1774],[39,1,9532,0,0,0,7019,2138],[40,1,8402,0,0,0,6736,1232],[41,1,12425,0,0,0,9955,2029],[42,1,10978,0,0,0,9367,1163],[43,1,9987,0,0,0,8569,974],[44,1,10616,0